{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And I also established My covenant, etc.</b> And also when I appeared to them as El Shaddai, I set and established My covenant between Me and them," "<b>To give them the land of Canaan.</b> To Avraham, in the pericope of circumcision, it is stated: ״אֲנִי אֵל שַׁדַּי וְגוֹ׳ וְנָתַתִּי לְךָ וּלְזַרְעֲךָ אַחֲרֶיךָ אֵת אֶרֶץ מְגֻרֶיךָ״ (Genesis 17); to Yitzchak: ״כִּי לְךָ וּלְזַרְעֲךָ אֶתֵּן אֶת כָּל הָאֲרָצֹת הָאֵל וַהֲקִמֹתִי אֶת הַשְּׁבֻעָה אֲשֶׁר נִשְׁבַּעְתִּי לְאַבְרָהָם״ (ibid. 26); and that oath that I swore to Avraham as El Shaddai, I said to Yaakov: ״אֲנִי אֵל שַׁדַּי פְּרֵה וּרְבֵה וְגוֹ׳ וְאֶת הָאָרֶץ אֲשֶׁר וְגוֹ׳״ (ibid. 35) — behold, I vowed to them and did not fulfill."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:45.973348634Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}